OL,3,A'Get out now' officials warn as Isaias
OL,4,Abarrels toward US Gulf Coast with
OL,5,A'devastating' winds
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Isaias is likely to bring a
OL,8,F"life-threatening storm surge" to the
OL,9,FUS Gulf Coast when it makes landfall,
OL,10,Fthe National Hurricane Center warns
OL,12,FFlorida is already feeling the initial
OL,13,Fimpacts, emergency management
OL,14,Fauthorities say, with Alabama, Georgia
OL,15,Fand Mississippi also bracing for heavy
OL,16,Frains and flooding
OL,18,F"Get out NOW!" warn some Florida
OL,19,Fofficials as they urge residents to
OL,20,Ffollow evacuation orders - see where
OL,21,Felse people are being asked to leave
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
