OL,3,A'Get out now' officials warn as Isaias
OL,4,Abarrels toward US Gulf Coast with
OL,5,A'devastating' winds
OL,6,
OL,7,FStates of emergency have been issued in
OL,8,Fparts of Alabama, Florida and in all of
OL,9,FGeorgia
OL,11,FUS President Donald Trump is no longer
OL,12,Fattending a major American football
OL,13,Fcollege game in Tuscaloosa, Alabama
OL,14,Fbecause of the storm
OL,16,FTravelling? Find out which airports
OL,17,Fhave closed and where train routes have
OL,18,Fbeen disrupted
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
