OL,3,AJD Vance casts doubt on firing squad
OL,4,Aexecution and says he will not watch it
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Vice-President JD Vance has cast
OL,7,Fdoubt on the Pentagon's plans to
OL,8,Flivestream a firing squad execution of
OL,9,Fthe Fort Hood shooter.
OL,11,FTalking with reporters, Vance expressed
OL,12,Fdoubt that the December execution would
OL,13,Fmove forward as planned, saying: "I
OL,14,Fdon't know that that's actually going
OL,15,Fto happen".
OL,17,FHe added, that "if it's through live
OL,18,Fstream, I'm not going to be watching
OL,19,Fit". Vance described the actions by
OL,20,Fformer US Army major Nidal Hasan as
OL,21,F"the worst terrorist attack on American
OL,22,Fsoil outside of 9/11".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
