OL,3,AJD Vance casts doubt on firing squad
OL,4,Aexecution and says he will not watch it
OL,5,
OL,6,FHasan fatally shot 13 unarmed US
OL,7,Fsoldiers at a base in Texas in 2009,
OL,8,Finjuring another 32. His execution by
OL,9,Ffiring squad would be the first
OL,10,Fmilitary execution in more than 60
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
